[
  {
    "filename": "2026-06-10-創意官吏獎得獎感言",
    "nest_filename": null,
    "nest_display_name": null,
    "section_id": 63856811,
    "previous_section_id": null,
    "next_section_id": 63856812,
    "section_speaker": "%E5%94%90%E9%B3%B3-3",
    "section_content": "<p>五千年前，尖筆壓進泥板。<br>\n最古老的書寫，是記帳：<br>\n村裡共有的資糧，<br>\n數清、存好，<br>\n讓全村活過冬天。</p>\n",
    "display_name": "2026-06-10 「創意官吏獎」得獎感言",
    "photoURL": "/media/speakers/default/pic_AudreyTang-small.jpg.96x96_q85_crop-smart_face_upscale.jpg",
    "name": "唐鳳"
  },
  {
    "filename": "2026-06-10-創意官吏獎得獎感言",
    "nest_filename": null,
    "nest_display_name": null,
    "section_id": 63856812,
    "previous_section_id": 63856811,
    "next_section_id": 63856813,
    "section_speaker": "%E5%94%90%E9%B3%B3-3",
    "section_content": "<p>第一位書寫者，是官吏。<br>\n帝國成塵，帳冊長存。</p>\n",
    "display_name": "2026-06-10 「創意官吏獎」得獎感言",
    "photoURL": "/media/speakers/default/pic_AudreyTang-small.jpg.96x96_q85_crop-smart_face_upscale.jpg",
    "name": "唐鳳"
  },
  {
    "filename": "2026-06-10-創意官吏獎得獎感言",
    "nest_filename": null,
    "nest_display_name": null,
    "section_id": 63856813,
    "previous_section_id": 63856812,
    "next_section_id": 63856814,
    "section_speaker": "%E5%94%90%E9%B3%B3-3",
    "section_content": "<p>泥板，是有記性的土壤。<br>\n資料也是：<br>\n攜手耕作，才會鮮活；<br>\n每次收成，就更肥沃。</p>\n",
    "display_name": "2026-06-10 「創意官吏獎」得獎感言",
    "photoURL": "/media/speakers/default/pic_AudreyTang-small.jpg.96x96_q85_crop-smart_face_upscale.jpg",
    "name": "唐鳳"
  },
  {
    "filename": "2026-06-10-創意官吏獎得獎感言",
    "nest_filename": null,
    "nest_display_name": null,
    "section_id": 63856814,
    "previous_section_id": 63856813,
    "next_section_id": 63856815,
    "section_speaker": "%E5%94%90%E9%B3%B3-3",
    "section_content": "<p>耕耘資料土壤，<br>\n不要開採資料石油。</p>\n",
    "display_name": "2026-06-10 「創意官吏獎」得獎感言",
    "photoURL": "/media/speakers/default/pic_AudreyTang-small.jpg.96x96_q85_crop-smart_face_upscale.jpg",
    "name": "唐鳳"
  },
  {
    "filename": "2026-06-10-創意官吏獎得獎感言",
    "nest_filename": null,
    "nest_display_name": null,
    "section_id": 63856815,
    "previous_section_id": 63856814,
    "next_section_id": 63856816,
    "section_speaker": "%E5%94%90%E9%B3%B3-3",
    "section_content": "<p>主權如果只靠一位好官，<br>\n那還不是主權，只是運氣。<br>\n在臺灣，我們把主權，<br>\n種進共有的土地：<br>\n沒有哪隻手，能連根拔起。</p>\n",
    "display_name": "2026-06-10 「創意官吏獎」得獎感言",
    "photoURL": "/media/speakers/default/pic_AudreyTang-small.jpg.96x96_q85_crop-smart_face_upscale.jpg",
    "name": "唐鳳"
  },
  {
    "filename": "2026-06-10-創意官吏獎得獎感言",
    "nest_filename": null,
    "nest_display_name": null,
    "section_id": 63856816,
    "previous_section_id": 63856815,
    "next_section_id": 63856817,
    "section_speaker": "%E5%94%90%E9%B3%B3-3",
    "section_content": "<p>有人說，官吏動得慢。<br>\n板塊也慢。</p>\n",
    "display_name": "2026-06-10 「創意官吏獎」得獎感言",
    "photoURL": "/media/speakers/default/pic_AudreyTang-small.jpg.96x96_q85_crop-smart_face_upscale.jpg",
    "name": "唐鳳"
  },
  {
    "filename": "2026-06-10-創意官吏獎得獎感言",
    "nest_filename": null,
    "nest_display_name": null,
    "section_id": 63856817,
    "previous_section_id": 63856816,
    "next_section_id": 63856818,
    "section_speaker": "%E5%94%90%E9%B3%B3-3",
    "section_content": "<p>是耐心和壓力，<br>\n讓我們的島嶼，<br>\n從海裡升起。</p>\n",
    "display_name": "2026-06-10 「創意官吏獎」得獎感言",
    "photoURL": "/media/speakers/default/pic_AudreyTang-small.jpg.96x96_q85_crop-smart_face_upscale.jpg",
    "name": "唐鳳"
  },
  {
    "filename": "2026-06-10-創意官吏獎得獎感言",
    "nest_filename": null,
    "nest_display_name": null,
    "section_id": 63856818,
    "previous_section_id": 63856817,
    "next_section_id": 63856849,
    "section_speaker": "%E5%94%90%E9%B3%B3-3",
    "section_content": "<p>現在帳冊數的，是聲音。<br>\n四百四十七位公民，<br>\n島嶼的縮影，<br>\n面對面審議，深偽如何因應。</p>\n",
    "display_name": "2026-06-10 「創意官吏獎」得獎感言",
    "photoURL": "/media/speakers/default/pic_AudreyTang-small.jpg.96x96_q85_crop-smart_face_upscale.jpg",
    "name": "唐鳳"
  },
  {
    "filename": "2026-06-10-創意官吏獎得獎感言",
    "nest_filename": null,
    "nest_display_name": null,
    "section_id": 63856849,
    "previous_section_id": 63856818,
    "next_section_id": 63856819,
    "section_speaker": "%E5%94%90%E9%B3%B3-3",
    "section_content": "<p>公僕把公民的決定，<br>\n帶進法律，<br>\n守住法律。</p>\n",
    "display_name": "2026-06-10 「創意官吏獎」得獎感言",
    "photoURL": "/media/speakers/default/pic_AudreyTang-small.jpg.96x96_q85_crop-smart_face_upscale.jpg",
    "name": "唐鳳"
  },
  {
    "filename": "2026-06-10-創意官吏獎得獎感言",
    "nest_filename": null,
    "nest_display_name": null,
    "section_id": 63856819,
    "previous_section_id": 63856849,
    "next_section_id": 63856892,
    "section_speaker": "%E5%94%90%E9%B3%B3-3",
    "section_content": "<p>一年至此，<br>\n冒名詐騙廣告，<br>\n少了百分之九十四。</p>\n",
    "display_name": "2026-06-10 「創意官吏獎」得獎感言",
    "photoURL": "/media/speakers/default/pic_AudreyTang-small.jpg.96x96_q85_crop-smart_face_upscale.jpg",
    "name": "唐鳳"
  },
  {
    "filename": "2026-06-10-創意官吏獎得獎感言",
    "nest_filename": null,
    "nest_display_name": null,
    "section_id": 63856892,
    "previous_section_id": 63856819,
    "next_section_id": 63856820,
    "section_speaker": "%E5%94%90%E9%B3%B3-3",
    "section_content": "<p>我們與全民攜手共創，<br>\n不只是服務人民。<br>\n與政府攜手共創，<br>\n不只是奉行政令。</p>\n",
    "display_name": "2026-06-10 「創意官吏獎」得獎感言",
    "photoURL": "/media/speakers/default/pic_AudreyTang-small.jpg.96x96_q85_crop-smart_face_upscale.jpg",
    "name": "唐鳳"
  },
  {
    "filename": "2026-06-10-創意官吏獎得獎感言",
    "nest_filename": null,
    "nest_display_name": null,
    "section_id": 63856820,
    "previous_section_id": 63856892,
    "next_section_id": 63856821,
    "section_speaker": "%E5%94%90%E9%B3%B3-3",
    "section_content": "<p>你們有個美麗的說法，<br>\n稱我們「創意官吏」。<br>\n最古老的書寫者，<br>\n繼續寫下一筆。</p>\n",
    "display_name": "2026-06-10 「創意官吏獎」得獎感言",
    "photoURL": "/media/speakers/default/pic_AudreyTang-small.jpg.96x96_q85_crop-smart_face_upscale.jpg",
    "name": "唐鳳"
  },
  {
    "filename": "2026-06-10-創意官吏獎得獎感言",
    "nest_filename": null,
    "nest_display_name": null,
    "section_id": 63856821,
    "previous_section_id": 63856820,
    "next_section_id": 63856822,
    "section_speaker": "%E5%94%90%E9%B3%B3-3",
    "section_content": "<p>這座獎，不是我一個人的。<br>\n今夜某處，公僕還守在桌前：<br>\n工作攤在光下，<br>\n寒冬擋在門邊。</p>\n",
    "display_name": "2026-06-10 「創意官吏獎」得獎感言",
    "photoURL": "/media/speakers/default/pic_AudreyTang-small.jpg.96x96_q85_crop-smart_face_upscale.jpg",
    "name": "唐鳳"
  },
  {
    "filename": "2026-06-10-創意官吏獎得獎感言",
    "nest_filename": null,
    "nest_display_name": null,
    "section_id": 63856822,
    "previous_section_id": 63856821,
    "next_section_id": 63856850,
    "section_speaker": "%E5%94%90%E9%B3%B3-3",
    "section_content": "<p>穀倉守住，<br>\n因為有你。</p>\n",
    "display_name": "2026-06-10 「創意官吏獎」得獎感言",
    "photoURL": "/media/speakers/default/pic_AudreyTang-small.jpg.96x96_q85_crop-smart_face_upscale.jpg",
    "name": "唐鳳"
  },
  {
    "filename": "2026-06-10-創意官吏獎得獎感言",
    "nest_filename": null,
    "nest_display_name": null,
    "section_id": 63856850,
    "previous_section_id": 63856822,
    "next_section_id": null,
    "section_speaker": "%E5%94%90%E9%B3%B3-3",
    "section_content": "<p>謝謝你。</p>\n",
    "display_name": "2026-06-10 「創意官吏獎」得獎感言",
    "photoURL": "/media/speakers/default/pic_AudreyTang-small.jpg.96x96_q85_crop-smart_face_upscale.jpg",
    "name": "唐鳳"
  }
]
